144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 102 0 R
/T (A retrospective meeting is held at the end of each sprint. The team, including developers, QA, and BA, meets to reflect on their work. During the meeting, participants take turns to share what went well, what challenges they faced, and what improvements can be made. They also share their input on the process and teamwork. Team members may point out key problems and propose solutions. Based on the discussion, the team aligns on a few action items to improve the next sprint.)
/E (A retrospective meeting is held at the end of each sprint. The team, including developers, QA, and BA, meets to reflect on their work. During the meeting, participants take turns to share what went well, what challenges they faced, and what improvements can be made. They also share their input on the process and teamwork. Team members may point out key problems and propose solutions. Based on the discussion, the team aligns on a few action items to improve the next sprint.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
